The MIT licence covers the code, text and illustrations made for this project
(the illustrations in prototype/assets/*.webp were AI-generated for it). It
does not cover the third-party material below, which keeps its own terms:

- Gabriel data (data/, prototype/data.json and the numbers on the built
  pages). Gabriel buoy, operated by Amalie Skram VGS, UiB and Bergen Marine
  Forskningsklynge, downloaded from Ekte data (https://ektedata.uib.no/gabriel/).
  The data is free for everyone, but published data must be cited, and
  Skolelab (post@skolelab.uib.no) asks to be told before Gabriel data is
  published. Citation:

    Muilwijk, M., Drange, H., Paasche, Ø. (2017). Gabriel conductivity-
    temperature-depth (CTD), oxygen, fluorescence and turbidity data from
    Store Lungegårdsvann in Bergen [Data set]. University of Bergen, Norway.

- Fonts (prototype/assets/font-*.woff2). Raleway, Copyright 2010 The Raleway
  Project Authors, Reserved Font Name "Raleway"; Open Sans, Copyright 2020 The
  Open Sans Project Authors. Both under the SIL Open Font License 1.1; the
  full texts are in prototype/assets/font-*-OFL.txt and are served at
  /licenses/ on the site.
